      "works_on": ["ingredient/salt-cod"],
      "with": ["ingredient/water"],
      "text": "Put the cod skin side up in a bowl of cold water in the fridge. Change the water several times, until the fish has lost most of its salt and tastes pleasant when a small piece is tried.",
