      "with": [
        "ingredient/garlic", "ingredient/olive-oil", "ingredient/water", "ingredient/stale-bread", "ingredient/salt"
      ],
      "text": "Soak the dried peppers in hot water until soft, scrape out the pulp and keep the water. Cook the onion and the garlic in the oil, lid ajar, over a very low heat until soft, sweet and pale. Add the pulp, a ladle of the soaking water and the bread, simmer until the onion falls apart, then rub the sauce through a sieve. Season it at the end.",
